<title>FRANCE: Port conditions update - France -  Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - France -  Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>BERRE, LAVERA, June 21 - A tugboat strike that began a month ago in Fos has prevented tankers from unloading their shipment of crude oil in the past week. The strike is affecting Shell's Berre refinery and BP's Lavera facility, but not operations at Marseilles.</p>
</text>
